# Eval slice for gated consolidation. Format: <query> ||| <token that must stay retrievable in CLAIMS.md>
# A consolidation pass is KEPT only if every line still passes and total size dropped; else it reverts.
which engine does rralph default to? ||| defaults to the `pi` engine
can I attach to the live rralph tmux pane to check on it? ||| corrupts the driver's paste/marker detection
how do I find the live rralph socket? ||| not `ls -t`
what order do the RPIV pipeline steps run in? ||| research → design → plan → implement → validate → code-review → commit
how does rpiv-merge pick the base branch? ||| .rpiv/run/<TS>/.base
